  "notes": "Complete JR Central Towers passenger-building exterior as the main Nagoya Station model:both distinctive curved towers withflatservicebacks,roofcrown/disc,sharedmultilevelpodium,centralglazedspine,terraces/closedentrances andattachednorthhall. Include eightmappedJR platformcanopieswithopen sides/supports behindthebuilding. PreserveJR GateTower,JPTower,Meitetsu/Kintetsu andotherindependentbuildings,roads/rails/platformsurfaces. Originalmedium-fi returns andunseenopeninginventory;no navigableinterior orcopiedbrands. Two ordinary pictures plus standard viewerPMTiles andTerrarium only. No downloaded meshes or bespoke research. Picturefilesremainlocal andarenot textures. Whole principal passenger ensemble only. Deep podium ledges and recessed glazing are modeled; hidden service returns,roof inventory,entrance/crown details andeight platformcanopies are original medium-fi approximations. No copied corporate lettering/brands,navigable interior,independent JR GateTower/JP Tower,Meitetsu/Kintetsu,tracks or platform surface replacement. Coarse standard field hasstrong urban returns;native site acceptance remains pending current field inspection. Physical-device timing andnumerical LOD errors remain unmeasured.",
