    "notes": "All 9 current portable views actually inspected. Complete principal JR Central Towers passenger ensemble: both distinctive curved towers and flat service returns, unequal roof ends, rounded hotel crown and projecting upper disc with supports, shared podium with repeated pale floor ledges and recessed glazing, uninterrupted central glazed spine, closed entry glazing and actual door frames, shallow street canopy, attached north hall, eight mapped open-sided JR platform canopies and supported transverse concourse. Floors and roofs are closed where occupied; no floor or solid wall fills the railway platform areas. Tower fins keep the same spacing across detailed curve levels. Hidden returns, roof services, entrance details and canopy supports are original medium-fi approximations; no corporate lettering, copied brands, interiors or unrelated nearby towers."
